{"slug": "C_S02E12", "video_name": "Community - S02E12 - Asian Population Studies Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E12 - Asian Population Studies Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1277.782, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 550, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 11.0, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 11.0, "end": 13.0, "text": "Did everyone have a good break?"}, {"start": 13.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "Yeah, I discovered a new back muscle to work out."}, {"start": 15.0, "end": 18.0, "text": "Ladies, you'll thank me come tank top season."}, {"start": 18.0, "end": 21.0, "text": "I checked all of Pierce's wardrobes for portals to magical worlds."}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 24.0, "text": "All I found was something called a manual in space on Laserdisc."}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 27.0, "text": "I couldn't watch it, but it sounded sexy."}, {"start": 27.0, "end": 28.0, "text": "Laserdisc."}, {"start": 28.0, "end": 31.0, "text": "I joined a campus volunteer group that cleans the city."}, {"start": 31.0, "end": 33.0, "text": "We picked up litter on the freeway and dredged the river."}, {"start": 33.0, "end": 34.0, "text": "Dredged for what?"}, {"start": 34.0, "end": 36.0, "text": "You know, garbage and stuff."}, {"start": 36.0, "end": 38.0, "text": "Tires, condoms, needles."}, {"start": 38.0, "end": 40.0, "text": "At one point we found a finger."}, {"start": 40.0, "end": 43.0, "text": "Why are you using your \"I love butterflies\" voice?"}, {"start": 43.0, "end": 43.43478260869565, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 43.43478260869565, "end": 43.8695652173913, "text": "Am I?"}, {"start": 43.8695652173913, "end": 45.0, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 45.0, "end": 46.559322033898304, "text": "Volunteer work is nice."}, {"start": 46.559322033898304, "end": 49.0, "text": "You do nice things with nice people."}, {"start": 49.0, "end": 51.0, "text": "Ooh!"}, {"start": 51.0, "end": 54.0, "text": "Somebody's finding river fingers with the cute boy."}, {"start": 54.0, "end": 55.25, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 55.25, "end": 56.0, "text": "No."}, {"start": 56.0, "end": 59.0, "text": "Well, okay, yes, but it doesn't matter."}, {"start": 59.0, "end": 60.254901960784316, "text": "It's not like I'm seeing anyone."}, {"start": 60.254901960784316, "end": 61.0, "text": "They're just a guy."}, {"start": 61.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "A guy that goes to Greendale?"}, {"start": 62.0, "end": 63.0, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 63.0, "end": 64.0, "text": "Is it the Russian guy that looks like a short Johnny Depp?"}, {"start": 64.0, "end": 65.0, "text": "It doesn't matter."}, {"start": 65.0, "end": 67.0, "text": "Is it the guy who looks a little like Vince Bomba, smells a lot like fish?"}, {"start": 67.0, "end": 69.0, "text": "I don't want to talk about it."}, {"start": 69.0, "end": 72.0, "text": "Well, I have someone in my life that I'm happy to talk about."}, {"start": 72.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "Again with the Jesus."}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 75.80434782608695, "text": "Jesus is always in my life, but things have"}, {"start": 75.80434782608695, "end": 79.0, "text": "been looking better every day with my ex-husband."}, {"start": 79.0, "end": 80.56976744186046, "text": "Is it the guy that looks like Anderson Cooper"}, {"start": 80.56976744186046, "end": 82.0, "text": "but with the soul patch and the ponytail?"}, {"start": 82.0, "end": 83.0, "text": "No."}, {"start": 83.0, "end": 84.0, "text": "Is it Black Michael Chickless?"}, {"start": 84.0, "end": 85.0, "text": "No."}, {"start": 85.0, "end": 86.0, "text": "Is it Black George Horan?"}, {"start": 86.0, "end": 87.0, "text": "You guys are talking about the same person."}, {"start": 87.0, "end": 90.0, "text": "He's biracial, his name is David, and he's a human being."}, {"start": 90.0, "end": 90.97560975609755, "text": "Guys, stop guessing."}, {"start": 90.97560975609755, "end": 92.14634146341463, "text": "It's not a thing at all."}, {"start": 92.14634146341463, "end": 93.07317073170731, "text": "It's just a friend."}, {"start": 93.07317073170731, "end": 94.0, "text": "Change the subject."}, {"start": 94.0, "end": 95.0, "text": "Chang the subject?"}, {"start": 95.0, "end": 97.0, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 97.0, "end": 99.0, "text": "What are you doing up there?"}, {"start": 99.0, "end": 101.84946236559139, "text": "It's the beginning of a new semester of anthropology,"}, {"start": 101.84946236559139, "end": 104.0, "text": "and I'm here to get what I was promised."}, {"start": 104.0, "end": 104.27027027027027, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 104.27027027027027, "end": 106.0, "text": "Who has Chang's pile of nothing?"}, {"start": 106.0, "end": 107.3125, "text": "You know what I mean."}, {"start": 107.3125, "end": 109.0, "text": "I am sick of the runaround."}, {"start": 109.0, "end": 113.0, "text": "I'm here to demand an immediate answer about whether I'm joining the study group."}, {"start": 113.0, "end": 116.0, "text": "Well, if we have to give an immediate answer, it would have to be no."}, {"start": 116.0, "end": 120.29824561403508, "text": "Take your time, sleep on it, then get back to me."}, {"start": 120.29824561403508, "end": 121.0, "text": "Or else."}, {"start": 124.0, "end": 127.0, "text": "Jeff, you did say we would let him in eventually."}, {"start": 127.0, "end": 129.75675675675674, "text": "That was before he started using his name as a pun."}, {"start": 129.75675675675674, "end": 131.0, "text": "It makes me so Changry."}, {"start": 131.0, "end": 133.0, "text": "Oh, God, it's happening to me."}, {"start": 133.0, "end": 134.48275862068965, "text": "Let's get back to who Annie's in love with."}, {"start": 134.48275862068965, "end": 135.0, "text": "Is it Fat Neil?"}, {"start": 135.0, "end": 136.0, "text": "Blue Streak?"}, {"start": 136.0, "end": 137.0, "text": "Optimus Prime?"}, {"start": 137.0, "end": 139.0, "text": "Okay, even I know some of these are Transformers."}, {"start": 139.0, "end": 140.0810810810811, "text": "Who cares who it is?"}, {"start": 140.0810810810811, "end": 141.0, "text": "Let's just study."}, {"start": 141.0, "end": 141.2391304347826, "text": "Study what?"}, {"start": 141.2391304347826, "end": 142.0, "text": "We haven't had our first class yet."}, {"start": 142.0, "end": 144.0, "text": "Well, can we talk about something other than Annie's love life?"}, {"start": 144.0, "end": 146.0, "text": "We could talk about my love life."}, {"start": 147.0, "end": 149.0, "text": "Is it Jean-Claude Van Overbite?"}, {"start": 149.0, "end": 151.0, "text": "We should really start learning people's names."}, {"start": 151.0, "end": 154.0, "text": "I agree with Brown, Jamie Lee Curtis."}, {"start": 173.0, "end": 177.0, "text": "♪ Walk, bow, walk, they are just days ♪"}, {"start": 180.0, "end": 182.0, "text": "Duncan's late."}, {"start": 182.0, "end": 185.0, "text": "I hope he didn't drive his car into another marathon."}, {"start": 185.0, "end": 188.0, "text": "Shirley, how can you want to date your ex-husband after what he did to you?"}, {"start": 188.0, "end": 189.0, "text": "He apologized."}, {"start": 189.0, "end": 190.02857142857144, "text": "Oh, he apologized."}, {"start": 190.02857142857144, "end": 193.0, "text": "Well, I guess that completely unbangs that stripper."}, {"start": 193.0, "end": 194.97333333333333, "text": "Well, forgive me for being forgiving."}, {"start": 194.97333333333333, "end": 195.98666666666665, "text": "Well, that's right."}, {"start": 195.98666666666665, "end": 197.0, "text": "You don't know how."}, {"start": 197.0, "end": 200.0, "text": "I'm relieved Shirley is seeing her ex-husband and not Chang."}, {"start": 200.0, "end": 200.35294117647058, "text": "Chang?"}, {"start": 200.35294117647058, "end": 202.0, "text": "Why would she be with Chang?"}, {"start": 202.0, "end": 204.0, "text": "Why do I have to say everything I'm thinking?"}, {"start": 204.0, "end": 207.0, "text": "I wish my mouth was further away from my brain."}, {"start": 207.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "I wish my brain had its own brain."}, {"start": 209.0, "end": 211.0, "text": "I wish Chang hadn't had sex with Shirley."}, {"start": 211.0, "end": 211.9375, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 211.9375, "end": 212.875, "text": "When?"}, {"start": 212.875, "end": 214.0, "text": "Where?"}, {"start": 215.0, "end": 216.0, "text": "How?"}, {"start": 216.0, "end": 218.0, "text": "I can't talk about it."}, {"start": 218.0, "end": 219.16666666666666, "text": "Oh, Troy, I'm your roommate."}, {"start": 219.16666666666666, "end": 220.0, "text": "I can keep a secret."}, {"start": 221.0, "end": 221.234375, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 221.234375, "end": 224.0, "text": "Remember that Halloween party that none of us can remember?"}, {"start": 224.0, "end": 226.0, "text": "I don't remember anything we can remember."}, {"start": 226.0, "end": 229.0, "text": "Well, Chang left me a message that night saying that they did it."}, {"start": 229.0, "end": 231.0, "text": "But you can't tell anybody."}, {"start": 231.0, "end": 237.0, "text": "You have my word as your roommate, and that is a bond I will never violate."}, {"start": 238.0, "end": 239.0, "text": "You can't tweet it either."}, {"start": 239.0, "end": 241.0, "text": "We never discuss new media."}, {"start": 241.0, "end": 245.0, "text": "Sorry all that stuff got dragged out about me having a crush on somebody."}, {"start": 245.0, "end": 246.0, "text": "Why would you be sorry about that?"}, {"start": 246.0, "end": 249.0, "text": "You know, awkward."}, {"start": 249.0, "end": 251.0, "text": "Annie, you don't think I actually care, do you?"}, {"start": 251.0, "end": 251.35593220338984, "text": "No, no."}, {"start": 251.35593220338984, "end": 254.0, "text": "I just didn't want you to think I thought you cared."}, {"start": 254.0, "end": 257.3888888888889, "text": "Greetings all and sundry, and welcome to your second semester"}, {"start": 257.3888888888889, "end": 260.0, "text": "of anthropology, where it is about to get real."}, {"start": 260.0, "end": 263.29411764705884, "text": "Now, I forget where we left off last year."}, {"start": 263.29411764705884, "end": 264.0, "text": "Fat Neil."}, {"start": 264.0, "end": 265.0, "text": "The Bronze Age?"}, {"start": 265.0, "end": 266.0, "text": "Thank you, Fat Neil."}, {"start": 266.0, "end": 267.0, "text": "Neil's fine."}, {"start": 267.0, "end": 269.0, "text": "Not from an actuarial standpoint."}, {"start": 269.0, "end": 274.0, "text": "Now, please forgive my lateness, but I wasn't sure how to find Greendale sober."}, {"start": 275.0, "end": 277.0, "text": "Yes, you heard me right."}, {"start": 277.0, "end": 279.0, "text": "I have stopped drinking."}, {"start": 279.0, "end": 280.0, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 280.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "Mainly due to the fact that I could no longer get an erection."}, {"start": 283.0, "end": 286.9611650485437, "text": "Now that I'm on the wagon, you can expect both this"}, {"start": 286.9611650485437, "end": 291.0, "text": "class and my penis to be more focused and rewarding."}, {"start": 291.0, "end": 294.0, "text": "Also, there's going to be more than one diorama."}, {"start": 294.0, "end": 295.0, "text": "Blaine!"}, {"start": 295.0, "end": 297.0, "text": "I am so sorry."}, {"start": 297.0, "end": 301.0, "text": "I trained seeing eye dogs, and today was graduation."}, {"start": 301.0, "end": 304.0, "text": "I couldn't leave without shaking all their little paws."}, {"start": 304.0, "end": 305.0, "text": "Oh, Rich."}, {"start": 305.0, "end": 306.0, "text": "Jeff!"}, {"start": 306.0, "end": 307.0, "text": "Rich!"}, {"start": 307.0, "end": 308.0, "text": "Annie!"}, {"start": 308.0, "end": 309.0, "text": "Annie."}, {"start": 309.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "Rich."}, {"start": 310.0, "end": 311.0, "text": "You're taking anthropology?"}, {"start": 311.0, "end": 312.0, "text": "You made it sound so fun."}, {"start": 312.0, "end": 314.0, "text": "We spent the holiday break dredging a river together."}, {"start": 314.0, "end": 315.0, "text": "We found--"}, {"start": 315.0, "end": 316.0, "text": "A finger, yeah."}, {"start": 316.0, "end": 317.0, "text": "It sounds gruesome, I know."}, {"start": 317.0, "end": 320.0, "text": "But I'm used to seeing that kind of thing because I'm a doctor."}, {"start": 320.0, "end": 321.0, "text": "Neil!"}, {"start": 321.0, "end": 322.0, "text": "Oh, that's true."}, {"start": 322.0, "end": 323.0, "text": "You're valued."}, {"start": 323.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "Wow, I got you."}, {"start": 324.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "Hey, can't believe Rich actually enrolled in our class."}, {"start": 327.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "It means he likes me, right?"}, {"start": 329.0, "end": 330.2105263157895, "text": "Why wouldn't he, Annie?"}, {"start": 330.2105263157895, "end": 331.0, "text": "He is so sweet."}, {"start": 331.0, "end": 333.0, "text": "Yes, sweet and wise."}, {"start": 333.0, "end": 335.0, "text": "He has lived such a long, full life."}, {"start": 335.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "How old is he again?"}, {"start": 336.0, "end": 337.0, "text": "Thirty-something, I'm assuming."}, {"start": 337.0, "end": 339.0, "text": "He has a landline and uses the word \"album.\""}, {"start": 339.0, "end": 341.0, "text": "You guys don't think he's too old for me, do you?"}, {"start": 341.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "No."}, {"start": 342.0, "end": 343.0, "text": "No, come on."}, {"start": 343.0, "end": 347.0, "text": "By that logic, I wouldn't have a shot with anybody at this table."}, {"start": 347.0, "end": 351.0, "text": "Speaking of creepy, sober Duncan is worse than drunk Duncan."}, {"start": 351.0, "end": 353.0, "text": "I think this class is about to get really hard."}, {"start": 353.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "I have an idea about that."}, {"start": 354.0, "end": 357.0, "text": "Rich is really smart, and he knows a lot about anthropology."}, {"start": 357.0, "end": 359.0, "text": "If we were to start studying with him, I think it could help a lot."}, {"start": 359.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "Plus, you know."}, {"start": 362.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "Oh, you know what, though?"}, {"start": 364.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "I just realized it's so unfair to so many people, right?"}, {"start": 369.0, "end": 370.6736842105263, "text": "Britta, you're always talking about how it's weird we"}, {"start": 370.6736842105263, "end": 372.0, "text": "have no one of Latin descent in our group."}, {"start": 372.0, "end": 373.0, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 373.0, "end": 375.09090909090907, "text": "And, Pierce, you're always looking for someone"}, {"start": 375.09090909090907, "end": 377.0, "text": "old enough to find your racism subversive."}, {"start": 377.0, "end": 379.0, "text": "I could go on and on."}, {"start": 379.0, "end": 380.8333333333333, "text": "And there's a process."}, {"start": 380.8333333333333, "end": 382.0, "text": "It takes time."}, {"start": 382.0, "end": 383.95402298850576, "text": "Well, then I say we gather all the"}, {"start": 383.95402298850576, "end": 387.0, "text": "candidates and make an informed, democratic decision."}, {"start": 387.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "We can have a little mixer and invite the people we're submitting for consideration."}, {"start": 391.0, "end": 392.0, "text": "All in favor of tonight?"}, {"start": 392.0, "end": 394.0, "text": "Oh, I am."}, {"start": 394.0, "end": 394.4347826086956, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 394.4347826086956, "end": 395.0, "text": "I'm finished."}, {"start": 395.0, "end": 397.0, "text": "No, I'd say you've got about two more good years."}, {"start": 397.0, "end": 399.0, "text": "Oh, everyone."}, {"start": 399.0, "end": 402.0, "text": "This is Andre, my ex-husband and boyfriend."}, {"start": 402.0, "end": 404.0, "text": "He came to spend the day with me."}, {"start": 404.0, "end": 405.0, "text": "Hey, nice to meet you guys."}, {"start": 405.0, "end": 407.0, "text": "You know, I've heard a lot about every last one of you."}, {"start": 407.0, "end": 411.0, "text": "We haven't heard a lot about you or what you've done or with who."}, {"start": 411.0, "end": 413.09302325581393, "text": "Well, I hope you give me a chance to"}, {"start": 413.09302325581393, "end": 416.0, "text": "make up for everything you haven't heard about me."}, {"start": 416.0, "end": 418.0, "text": "Hey, how about a round of soft serve on me?"}, {"start": 421.0, "end": 425.0, "text": "Shirley, I've been fed a lot of soft serve by a lot of guys."}, {"start": 425.0, "end": 426.23809523809524, "text": "Sometimes it's rent money."}, {"start": 426.23809523809524, "end": 428.0, "text": "Sometimes it's chili peppers tickets."}, {"start": 428.0, "end": 429.4925373134328, "text": "And, yeah, I'll admit it."}, {"start": 429.4925373134328, "end": 432.0, "text": "One time it was a gym bag full of nickels."}, {"start": 432.0, "end": 435.0, "text": "But it never lasts and they never change."}, {"start": 435.0, "end": 437.0, "text": "Britta, I'm a grown-ass woman and I made my decision."}, {"start": 437.0, "end": 439.0, "text": "But how do you know it's the right one?"}, {"start": 439.0, "end": 441.0, "text": "Because I'm pregnant, okay?"}, {"start": 441.0, "end": 444.0, "text": "I was going to wait to share my exciting news."}, {"start": 447.515, "end": 451.515, "text": "But I guess now is as good a time as any to tell you that I am eight weeks in love,"}, {"start": 451.515, "end": 454.515, "text": "which is a little surprising."}, {"start": 454.515, "end": 456.4380769230769, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 456.4380769230769, "end": 459.515, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 459.515, "end": 463.515, "text": "Thanks for coming, fellow anthropology students."}, {"start": 463.515, "end": 466.515, "text": "For the first semester, you knew us as that study group."}, {"start": 466.515, "end": 469.515, "text": "But tonight, we want to get to know you."}, {"start": 469.515, "end": 470.3275, "text": "Please forgive the spread."}, {"start": 470.3275, "end": 472.515, "text": "The vending machines haven't been restocked since before winter break."}, {"start": 472.515, "end": 476.515, "text": "So help yourselves to tropical skittles, cigarettes, or mouthwash."}, {"start": 476.515, "end": 480.515, "text": "And, uh, have a good time."}, {"start": 480.515, "end": 481.515, "text": "Go ahead."}, {"start": 481.515, "end": 481.85207865168536, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 481.85207865168536, "end": 487.515, "text": "So I have to figure out Shirley did it with her ex-husband the week after Halloween."}, {"start": 487.515, "end": 489.515, "text": "How are you going to do that?"}, {"start": 489.515, "end": 491.515, "text": "I got moves."}, {"start": 491.515, "end": 493.515, "text": "So, blood in the oven."}, {"start": 493.515, "end": 496.515, "text": "Guess there's no surprise after working on it all this time."}, {"start": 496.515, "end": 498.155, "text": "Well, I wouldn't quite say working on it."}, {"start": 498.155, "end": 499.515, "text": "It just kind of happens, you know?"}, {"start": 499.515, "end": 500.41499999999996, "text": "Oh, yeah, I do."}, {"start": 500.41499999999996, "end": 502.515, "text": "Especially when the season's right."}, {"start": 502.515, "end": 505.515, "text": "Uh, dead leaves, pumpkins everywhere."}, {"start": 505.515, "end": 508.515, "text": "Nature's Viagra, right?"}, {"start": 508.515, "end": 509.515, "text": "I guess."}, {"start": 509.515, "end": 511.515, "text": "And when all the pumpkins just start to rot,"}, {"start": 511.515, "end": 514.515, "text": "and all the children have removed their outfits,"}, {"start": 514.515, "end": 517.515, "text": "because they've already gotten their candy."}, {"start": 517.515, "end": 520.515, "text": "Now, I'm gonna go talk to some other people, all right?"}, {"start": 528.437, "end": 529.437, "text": "So?"}, {"start": 529.437, "end": 530.0821612903226, "text": "It's mine."}, {"start": 530.0821612903226, "end": 531.437, "text": "It's like a fortress."}, {"start": 531.437, "end": 534.437, "text": "Why don't we just tell Shirley, hey, look, you slept with Chang."}, {"start": 534.437, "end": 536.437, "text": "We let her deal with it."}, {"start": 536.437, "end": 539.437, "text": "Piers, if someone had sex with Chang, and they get to not remember that happened,"}, {"start": 539.437, "end": 541.437, "text": "that's a gift from God."}, {"start": 541.437, "end": 543.437, "text": "I'm not taking that away from her without a good reason."}, {"start": 543.437, "end": 544.437, "text": "Well, here's a good reason."}, {"start": 544.437, "end": 546.437, "text": "You ever go to the bathroom and find Parsley in your teeth"}, {"start": 546.437, "end": 548.437, "text": "that your friends hadn't told you about?"}, {"start": 548.437, "end": 553.437, "text": "Now, imagine your teeth are uterus, and Parsley is a half-Chinese baby."}, {"start": 553.437, "end": 554.2478108108108, "text": "Hey, guys."}, {"start": 554.2478108108108, "end": 556.437, "text": "I want you to meet someone."}, {"start": 556.437, "end": 559.437, "text": "My name is Kendra, and I spell it with a Q-U."}, {"start": 559.437, "end": 561.437, "text": "She's thinking about taking anthropology,"}, {"start": 561.437, "end": 565.437, "text": "so maybe she would make a nice audition or two to our study group."}, {"start": 565.437, "end": 566.437, "text": "Something to consider."}, {"start": 566.437, "end": 567.737, "text": "Are you Abed?"}, {"start": 567.737, "end": 569.437, "text": "I love Star Wars."}, {"start": 569.437, "end": 571.437, "text": "That's right."}, {"start": 571.437, "end": 572.437, "text": "I love footballs."}, {"start": 572.437, "end": 574.437, "text": "Jeff, we're dealing with heavier things right now"}, {"start": 574.437, "end": 575.437, "text": "than your shameless lobbying."}, {"start": 575.437, "end": 577.437, "text": "Bridget brought kettle corn."}, {"start": 577.437, "end": 578.1036666666666, "text": "Cattle corn?"}, {"start": 578.1036666666666, "end": 579.437, "text": "That's a fun town snack."}, {"start": 579.437, "end": 579.8507931034483, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 579.8507931034483, "end": 581.437, "text": "I make it in my garage."}, {"start": 585.437, "end": 587.437, "text": "I spell kettle corn with a Q-U."}, {"start": 587.437, "end": 588.437, "text": "Well, don't."}, {"start": 588.437, "end": 589.3335517241379, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 589.3335517241379, "end": 590.437, "text": "What's going on?"}, {"start": 590.437, "end": 591.437, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 591.437, "end": 593.437, "text": "Why is everyone from anthro class here?"}, {"start": 593.437, "end": 595.437, "text": "Are you guys picking a new study group member?"}, {"start": 595.437, "end": 597.437, "text": "And you didn't invite me?"}, {"start": 597.437, "end": 599.437, "text": "We didn't know how to reach you."}, {"start": 599.437, "end": 600.7227142857143, "text": "What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 600.7227142857143, "end": 601.437, "text": "I'm everywhere."}, {"start": 601.437, "end": 602.437, "text": "We didn't know how to reach you."}, {"start": 602.437, "end": 603.5404482758621, "text": "That's not true."}, {"start": 603.5404482758621, "end": 604.437, "text": "That's a lie."}, {"start": 604.437, "end": 605.0147777777778, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 605.0147777777778, "end": 606.437, "text": "We didn't know how to reach you."}, {"start": 606.437, "end": 607.1036666666666, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 607.1036666666666, "end": 607.7703333333333, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 607.7703333333333, "end": 608.437, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 608.437, "end": 609.1036666666666, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 609.1036666666666, "end": 609.7703333333333, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 609.7703333333333, "end": 610.437, "text": "It's a mixer."}, {"start": 612.437, "end": 613.437, "text": "Works every time."}, {"start": 616.437, "end": 616.9703333333333, "text": "$50?"}, {"start": 616.9703333333333, "end": 618.437, "text": "What a pay."}, {"start": 625.437, "end": 628.437, "text": "Jeff, I think we should vote now."}, {"start": 628.437, "end": 631.437, "text": "Most people left after we ran out of Skittles, and come on."}, {"start": 631.437, "end": 633.437, "text": "It's pretty obvious Rich is the best candidate."}, {"start": 633.437, "end": 633.7431224489796, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 633.7431224489796, "end": 635.2125102040817, "text": "Looks like he's our guy."}, {"start": 635.2125102040817, "end": 636.437, "text": "I'll be right there."}, {"start": 637.437, "end": 638.91, "text": "This can't be happening."}, {"start": 638.91, "end": 641.15, "text": "- I agree."}, {"start": 641.15, "end": 643.15, "text": "(claps)"}, {"start": 645.91, "end": 647.63, "text": "You can't talk and then do a slow clap."}, {"start": 647.63, "end": 649.0699999999999, "text": "- You don't know that."}, {"start": 649.0699999999999, "end": 650.55, "text": "- But I know this."}, {"start": 650.55, "end": 653.51, "text": "Unless you want a front row seat to Annie Love's Richie,"}, {"start": 653.51, "end": 657.11, "text": "it's time to chain your point of view."}, {"start": 657.11, "end": 658.25, "text": "- It's not even clever."}, {"start": 658.25, "end": 660.5899999999999, "text": "You keep using it as the word change."}, {"start": 660.5899999999999, "end": 662.99, "text": "Okay, okay, okay."}, {"start": 665.6809999999999, "end": 668.8409999999999, "text": "Just do me a favor."}, {"start": 668.8409999999999, "end": 671.1209999999999, "text": "Let me do all the talking and follow my lead."}, {"start": 671.1209999999999, "end": 671.9609999999999, "text": "- Deal."}, {"start": 671.9609999999999, "end": 672.7809999999998, "text": "- Okay."}, {"start": 672.7809999999998, "end": 674.5209999999998, "text": "(claps)"}, {"start": 674.5209999999998, "end": 676.0409999999999, "text": "Seriously, do you have brain damage?"}, {"start": 676.0409999999999, "end": 678.4009999999998, "text": "- Rich is also board certified in pediatrics"}, {"start": 678.4009999999998, "end": 680.5009999999999, "text": "and once a month, he flies down to volunteer"}, {"start": 680.5009999999999, "end": 683.1209999999999, "text": "in the rain forest, fixing children's cleft pallets"}, {"start": 683.1209999999999, "end": 685.0809999999999, "text": "and teaching them acoustic guitar."}, {"start": 685.0809999999999, "end": 688.7209999999999, "text": "Other than that, well, his kettle corn speaks for itself."}, {"start": 688.7209999999999, "end": 690.2009999999999, "text": "- I couldn't agree more."}, {"start": 690.2009999999999, "end": 692.4009999999998, "text": "Looks like this is an open and shut case."}, {"start": 692.4009999999998, "end": 694.2409999999999, "text": "- Did someone say case?"}, {"start": 694.2409999999999, "end": 696.0409999999999, "text": "Because I haven't made mine yet."}, {"start": 696.0409999999999, "end": 697.0009999999999, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 697.0009999999999, "end": 698.0809999999999, "text": "What's your case?"}, {"start": 698.0809999999999, "end": 700.6009999999999, "text": "- Ben Chang is my case."}, {"start": 700.6009999999999, "end": 702.2809999999998, "text": "You can't be serious."}, {"start": 702.2809999999998, "end": 703.4409999999999, "text": "- Oh, I'm serious, baby."}, {"start": 703.4409999999999, "end": 704.6009999999999, "text": "I am Yahoo serious."}, {"start": 704.6009999999999, "end": 705.8009999999999, "text": "I'm serious FM."}, {"start": 705.8009999999999, "end": 707.9609999999999, "text": "Welcome to the world's serious of seriousness"}, {"start": 707.9609999999999, "end": 709.9209999999998, "text": "sponsored by Honey Nut Cereos."}, {"start": 709.9209999999998, "end": 711.4009999999998, "text": "- Are you stalling right now?"}, {"start": 711.4009999999998, "end": 712.3609999999999, "text": "- Stalling?"}, {"start": 714.7209999999999, "end": 715.8009999999999, "text": "Stalling."}, {"start": 715.8009999999999, "end": 716.8409999999999, "text": "No, Annie."}, {"start": 716.8409999999999, "end": 718.6009999999999, "text": "In fact, you're gonna wish I was stalling."}, {"start": 718.6009999999999, "end": 719.4409999999999, "text": "Oh, I just got it."}, {"start": 719.4409999999999, "end": 720.281, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 723.1009999999999, "end": 724.5609999999999, "text": "I wanna say some names to you."}, {"start": 724.5609999999999, "end": 725.7209999999999, "text": "- Awesome."}, {"start": 725.7209999999999, "end": 726.5809999999999, "text": "- Jeffrey Dahmer."}, {"start": 727.7609999999999, "end": 728.6409999999998, "text": "Ted Bundy."}, {"start": 730.4809999999999, "end": 731.3209999999999, "text": "Rich."}, {"start": 732.3209999999999, "end": 733.6809999999999, "text": "What do they have in common?"}, {"start": 734.8409999999999, "end": 737.7609999999999, "text": "We don't know them very well."}, {"start": 737.7609999999999, "end": 739.5209999999998, "text": "What do we know about Ben Chang?"}, {"start": 740.5809999999999, "end": 741.4209999999998, "text": "We know he's nuts."}, {"start": 741.4209999999998, "end": 742.6409999999998, "text": "- Let him finish."}, {"start": 742.6409999999998, "end": 745.7609999999999, "text": "- We know he's dangerous, unpredictable, selfish."}, {"start": 745.7609999999999, "end": 748.3209999999999, "text": "We know he uses his name to make bad puns."}, {"start": 748.3209999999999, "end": 749.6009999999999, "text": "- Guilty as Chang'd."}, {"start": 749.6009999999999, "end": 752.7609999999999, "text": "- When he talks, he over and under emphasizes words"}, {"start": 752.7609999999999, "end": 754.1609999999998, "text": "seemingly at random."}, {"start": 754.1609999999998, "end": 757.9609999999999, "text": "When he eats, he holds his fork like a murderer's knife,"}, {"start": 757.9609999999999, "end": 760.9209999999998, "text": "gnawing at its skewered payload like a deranged"}, {"start": 760.9209999999998, "end": 761.8809999999999, "text": "woodland rodent."}, {"start": 761.8809999999999, "end": 762.7209999999999, "text": "- We're at home."}, {"start": 762.7209999999999, "end": 764.3609999999999, "text": "- We know he smells like Band-Aids."}, {"start": 764.3609999999999, "end": 766.6409999999998, "text": "We know he dresses like a Cuban cab driver."}, {"start": 766.6409999999998, "end": 770.3609999999999, "text": "We know he exhibits nay, flaunts proudly,"}, {"start": 770.3609999999999, "end": 773.0609999999999, "text": "obvious symptoms of over half a dozen disorders"}, {"start": 773.0609999999999, "end": 775.6409999999998, "text": "you wouldn't wish on your worst enemy's pants."}, {"start": 775.6409999999998, "end": 776.7609999999999, "text": "- Feel the heat."}, {"start": 776.7609999999999, "end": 779.9609999999999, "text": "- We know these things about Ben Chang"}, {"start": 779.9609999999999, "end": 783.3809999999999, "text": "and so much more than we ever wanted to know about him."}, {"start": 783.3809999999999, "end": 784.2209999999999, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 785.6009999999999, "end": 787.2609999999999, "text": "Because it's there."}, {"start": 787.2609999999999, "end": 789.5409999999999, "text": "It's on the surface."}, {"start": 789.5409999999999, "end": 792.3609999999999, "text": "What you see may be what you don't want,"}, {"start": 792.3609999999999, "end": 795.8009999999999, "text": "but it's also what you get."}, {"start": 797.0809999999999, "end": 797.9209999999998, "text": "- Whoa."}, {"start": 798.9209999999998, "end": 801.7209999999999, "text": "- Who is this kettle corn popping phantom?"}, {"start": 801.7209999999999, "end": 803.4609999999999, "text": "This human question mark."}, {"start": 803.4609999999999, "end": 806.1609999999998, "text": "This number eight scoop of vanilla tapioca"}, {"start": 806.1609999999998, "end": 809.5209999999998, "text": "with a PhD in being swell and a master's in,"}, {"start": 809.5209999999998, "end": 810.9209999999998, "text": "everybody loves me."}, {"start": 810.9209999999998, "end": 811.8809999999999, "text": "Who is it?"}, {"start": 814.8809999999999, "end": 815.8009999999999, "text": "We may never know."}, {"start": 818.0809999999999, "end": 820.281, "text": "I only know one thing."}, {"start": 822.0409999999999, "end": 824.281, "text": "Nobody is this good a person."}, {"start": 826.3209999999999, "end": 830.2409999999999, "text": "And nobody can get any worse than this."}, {"start": 831.6809999999999, "end": 832.9209999999998, "text": "- He's horrible."}, {"start": 834.7609999999999, "end": 835.6009999999999, "text": "- Now."}, {"start": 838.5609999999999, "end": 840.8009999999999, "text": "(clapping)"}, {"start": 842.9609999999999, "end": 845.0009999999999, "text": "Who's voting for Chang?"}, {"start": 847.281, "end": 849.0009999999999, "text": "Who's voting for Rich?"}, {"start": 852.7209999999999, "end": 853.5609999999999, "text": "- Shirley."}, {"start": 853.5609999999999, "end": 854.8009999999999, "text": "- No, what you gonna do, baby?"}, {"start": 854.8009999999999, "end": 855.6409999999998, "text": "- I don't know."}, {"start": 858.0809999999999, "end": 861.3209999999999, "text": "- Shirley, this is the best kelp corn I've ever had."}, {"start": 861.3209999999999, "end": 864.7209999999999, "text": "If you don't vote for Rich, I'll shatter your world."}, {"start": 864.7209999999999, "end": 865.5609999999999, "text": "- You gonna what?"}, {"start": 865.5609999999999, "end": 867.1209999999999, "text": "- I'll shatter your world."}, {"start": 867.1209999999999, "end": 869.0009999999999, "text": "- I heard you, I vote for Chang."}, {"start": 869.0009999999999, "end": 872.7609999999999, "text": "- Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!"}, {"start": 872.7609999999999, "end": 873.6009999999999, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 874.6009999999999, "end": 876.5609999999999, "text": "Chang and Shirley had sex on Halloween."}, {"start": 876.5609999999999, "end": 877.4009999999998, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 877.4009999999998, "end": 878.2409999999999, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 878.2409999999999, "end": 879.0809999999999, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 879.0809999999999, "end": 879.9209999999998, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 879.9209999999998, "end": 881.281, "text": "- You may be pregnant with this baby."}, {"start": 881.281, "end": 882.1209999999999, "text": "- No."}, {"start": 882.1209999999999, "end": 884.2409999999999, "text": "- No, no, no, no, no."}, {"start": 884.2409999999999, "end": 885.6809999999999, "text": "Pierce!"}, {"start": 885.6809999999999, "end": 887.0809999999999, "text": "- She crossed me."}, {"start": 887.0809999999999, "end": 889.0409999999999, "text": "Is that why you were subtly interrogating me"}, {"start": 889.0409999999999, "end": 891.2409999999999, "text": "about my sexual activity?"}, {"start": 891.2409999999999, "end": 892.0809999999999, "text": "- Troy."}, {"start": 892.0809999999999, "end": 893.9209999999998, "text": "- Chang left me a voicemail on Halloween"}, {"start": 895.0409999999999, "end": 896.4809999999999, "text": "to say that you two did it."}, {"start": 896.4809999999999, "end": 898.8809999999999, "text": "I could hear you in the background."}, {"start": 898.8809999999999, "end": 901.0809999999999, "text": "- Shirley, what is he talking about?"}, {"start": 901.0809999999999, "end": 902.761, "text": "- I don't remember that night."}, {"start": 902.761, "end": 904.1609999999998, "text": "Nobody remembers anything."}, {"start": 904.1609999999998, "end": 906.9409999999998, "text": "- Oh, now I understand these photos."}, {"start": 908.5609999999999, "end": 910.8009999999999, "text": "Do you mind if I forward these to my brother?"}, {"start": 910.8009999999999, "end": 913.1609999999998, "text": "- Oh, I want this man out of here!"}, {"start": 913.1609999999998, "end": 915.0009999999999, "text": "- Well, you just voted him in, so."}, {"start": 915.0009999999999, "end": 916.3809999999999, "text": "- What is wrong with you?"}, {"start": 916.3809999999999, "end": 919.1609999999998, "text": "Shirley is in crisis, this isn't silly anymore."}, {"start": 919.1609999999998, "end": 920.761, "text": "- I don't understand."}, {"start": 920.761, "end": 923.2409999999999, "text": "- Just, just wait, baby, I don't understand either,"}, {"start": 923.2409999999999, "end": 925.4409999999998, "text": "but we can work this out, we'll figure it out."}, {"start": 929.0009999999999, "end": 929.8409999999999, "text": "Andre, no!"}, {"start": 932.8409999999999, "end": 936.4809999999999, "text": "- I think that this is a good time to go."}, {"start": 936.4809999999999, "end": 937.4409999999998, "text": "- Rich!"}, {"start": 937.4409999999998, "end": 938.281, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 942.1209999999999, "end": 944.5609999999999, "text": "- You finally did it, Jeff Winger."}, {"start": 944.5609999999999, "end": 947.3609999999999, "text": "You finally hurt this group in a way that'll never heal."}, {"start": 949.7209999999999, "end": 950.7409999999999, "text": "Kettle corn!"}, {"start": 958.2409999999999, "end": 959.0809999999999, "text": "- There you are."}, {"start": 960.0409999999999, "end": 962.281, "text": "Can you please explain to me what the hell you've been doing?"}, {"start": 962.281, "end": 965.3609999999999, "text": "- Well, Annie, when a man loves food and beverages"}, {"start": 965.3609999999999, "end": 967.9609999999999, "text": "very much, and they pass through his system, they make--"}, {"start": 967.9609999999999, "end": 969.281, "text": "- I'm not in the mood, Jeff."}, {"start": 969.281, "end": 971.3209999999999, "text": "Explain your behavior with Rich today."}, {"start": 971.3209999999999, "end": 973.881, "text": "- Sorry, not everyone is as in love with Dr."}, {"start": 973.881, "end": 974.521, "text": "Do-No-Wrong"}, {"start": 974.521, "end": 975.5409999999999, "text": "as you are."}, {"start": 975.5409999999999, "end": 977.0809999999999, "text": "And don't say it's because I'm jealous"}, {"start": 977.0809999999999, "end": 978.0009999999999, "text": "of him being with you."}, {"start": 978.0009999999999, "end": 980.1209999999999, "text": "- Oh, come on, Jeff!"}, {"start": 980.1209999999999, "end": 981.281, "text": "I'm sick of this!"}, {"start": 981.281, "end": 982.6409999999998, "text": "One minute, I'm too young to date,"}, {"start": 982.6409999999998, "end": 984.8809999999999, "text": "the next you're trying to get rid of guys I like."}, {"start": 984.8809999999999, "end": 986.8409999999999, "text": "Either you want me, or you don't."}, {"start": 986.8409999999999, "end": 987.6809999999998, "text": "What's it gonna be?"}, {"start": 987.6809999999998, "end": 989.761, "text": "- I wish I could give you an answer that makes sense,"}, {"start": 989.761, "end": 992.0809999999999, "text": "but relationships are complicated,"}, {"start": 992.0809999999999, "end": 993.6009999999999, "text": "and we're in the men's room."}, {"start": 993.6009999999999, "end": 994.8009999999999, "text": "- Fine."}, {"start": 994.8009999999999, "end": 997.2409999999999, "text": "Well, I'm gonna ask Rich out."}, {"start": 997.2409999999999, "end": 998.8009999999999, "text": "Nothing complicated about that."}, {"start": 1002.7209999999999, "end": 1003.5609999999999, "text": "There you are."}, {"start": 1003.5609999999999, "end": 1004.9209999999998, "text": "- Did I walk into the wrong bathroom?"}, {"start": 1004.9209999999998, "end": 1006.6809999999998, "text": "- You have to find Andre and talk to him."}, {"start": 1006.6809999999998, "end": 1008.1209999999999, "text": "Shirley is devastated."}, {"start": 1008.1209999999999, "end": 1010.1609999999998, "text": "- Since when do you want him back in her life?"}, {"start": 1010.1609999999998, "end": 1012.0009999999999, "text": "- I don't deny that I'm not a fan of the guy,"}, {"start": 1012.0009999999999, "end": 1014.6009999999999, "text": "but I'm a fan of Shirley, and this is what she wants."}, {"start": 1023.0809999999999, "end": 1024.1209999999999, "text": "- Here you are."}, {"start": 1031.321, "end": 1032.1209999999999, "text": "- Mezzanine!"}, {"start": 1039.9609999999998, "end": 1040.801, "text": "- Nice sweater."}, {"start": 1041.9609999999998, "end": 1044.6009999999999, "text": "- My dad gave it to me."}, {"start": 1044.6009999999999, "end": 1045.6009999999999, "text": "- So, um--"}, {"start": 1045.6009999999999, "end": 1048.4809999999998, "text": "- Look, I'm not mad at Shirley."}, {"start": 1048.4809999999998, "end": 1049.6809999999998, "text": "- You're not?"}, {"start": 1049.6809999999998, "end": 1051.6809999999998, "text": "- No, I'm mad at myself."}, {"start": 1052.8809999999999, "end": 1054.4409999999998, "text": "You know, if I hadn't left her like I did,"}, {"start": 1054.4409999999998, "end": 1056.081, "text": "none of this would've happened."}, {"start": 1057.3609999999999, "end": 1060.081, "text": "You ever have something that you didn't truly appreciate"}, {"start": 1060.081, "end": 1061.801, "text": "until you didn't have it anymore?"}, {"start": 1061.801, "end": 1062.6409999999998, "text": "- Oh, yeah."}, {"start": 1063.801, "end": 1065.521, "text": "Caristina."}, {"start": 1065.521, "end": 1066.3609999999999, "text": "- Old girlfriend?"}, {"start": 1066.3609999999999, "end": 1067.4409999999998, "text": "- Almond facial scrub."}, {"start": 1067.4409999999998, "end": 1069.0009999999997, "text": "They only make it in Finland."}, {"start": 1070.081, "end": 1072.321, "text": "- The old me would've been long gone by now."}, {"start": 1073.321, "end": 1074.761, "text": "I didn't think I could ever change,"}, {"start": 1074.761, "end": 1075.6409999999998, "text": "but I'm gonna tell you,"}, {"start": 1075.6409999999998, "end": 1078.041, "text": "the love of a good woman means anything possible."}, {"start": 1081.4809999999998, "end": 1084.041, "text": "- It looks like I'm gonna be a daddy again."}, {"start": 1084.041, "end": 1084.8809999999999, "text": "- Yeah, but--"}, {"start": 1084.8809999999999, "end": 1088.0009999999997, "text": "- Hey, it doesn't matter who the baby's father is."}, {"start": 1088.0009999999997, "end": 1090.241, "text": "I'm in for the long run."}, {"start": 1090.241, "end": 1093.9209999999998, "text": "If it's mine, it's gonna be a great football player."}, {"start": 1093.9209999999998, "end": 1097.761, "text": "And if it's changed, we'll go for gold."}, {"start": 1106.761, "end": 1107.261, "text": "- Hey."}, {"start": 1107.261, "end": 1107.761, "text": "- Hey."}, {"start": 1110.6009999999999, "end": 1112.041, "text": "- Danny just texted me."}, {"start": 1112.041, "end": 1113.041, "text": "She asked for a job."}, {"start": 1114.4809999999998, "end": 1115.3609999999999, "text": "- Cool."}, {"start": 1115.3609999999999, "end": 1116.201, "text": "- He said no."}, {"start": 1117.4809999999998, "end": 1119.241, "text": "He said she's great, but too young."}, {"start": 1122.241, "end": 1124.841, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 1140.6009999999999, "end": 1143.3609999999999, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1153.041, "end": 1156.4809999999998, "text": "- Don't say anything until I've said what I gotta say."}, {"start": 1156.4809999999998, "end": 1158.321, "text": "I've known you for almost two years now,"}, {"start": 1158.321, "end": 1161.761, "text": "and I've never taken you as seriously as I should have."}, {"start": 1162.6409999999998, "end": 1165.721, "text": "You are the strangest, coolest,"}, {"start": 1165.721, "end": 1169.4409999999998, "text": "most genuine person I've ever met."}, {"start": 1169.4409999999998, "end": 1171.9209999999998, "text": "And the thing that scares me about you"}, {"start": 1171.9209999999998, "end": 1174.761, "text": "was how good you make me wish I was."}, {"start": 1176.801, "end": 1178.4409999999998, "text": "Help me, Rich."}, {"start": 1178.4409999999998, "end": 1179.801, "text": "Help me become like you."}, {"start": 1181.1209999999999, "end": 1185.3609999999999, "text": "I mean, I am so amazing,"}, {"start": 1187.201, "end": 1188.561, "text": "but I'm not perfect."}, {"start": 1190.4409999999998, "end": 1191.281, "text": "You are."}, {"start": 1193.0009999999997, "end": 1197.4009999999998, "text": "Give me that power so I can abuse it."}, {"start": 1199.0009999999997, "end": 1201.841, "text": "- Jeff, you are one funny bunny."}, {"start": 1201.841, "end": 1203.241, "text": "You can't just fake being good"}, {"start": 1203.241, "end": 1205.241, "text": "in order to get away with doing bad things."}, {"start": 1205.241, "end": 1207.321, "text": "- Oh, I completely understand."}, {"start": 1207.321, "end": 1211.1209999999999, "text": "And do you understand that I still have to try?"}, {"start": 1211.9609999999998, "end": 1215.841, "text": "And if you don't help me, you're a bad person."}, {"start": 1217.681, "end": 1219.6409999999998, "text": "- You got me there, guy."}, {"start": 1219.6409999999998, "end": 1221.0009999999997, "text": "Come on in and dry off."}, {"start": 1222.6409999999998, "end": 1224.721, "text": "Oh, it smells delicious."}, {"start": 1224.721, "end": 1225.561, "text": "Are you baking?"}, {"start": 1225.561, "end": 1226.761, "text": "- Nah, muffin tops."}, {"start": 1229.9609999999998, "end": 1230.801, "text": "- And we're back."}, {"start": 1230.801, "end": 1232.681, "text": "Today we'll show you how to make homemade kettle corn"}, {"start": 1232.681, "end": 1233.2471538461539, "text": "with Dr."}, {"start": 1233.2471538461539, "end": 1233.6009999999999, "text": "Rich."}, {"start": 1233.6009999999999, "end": 1235.681, "text": "- Rich, how do I get one of those giant spoons?"}, {"start": 1235.681, "end": 1237.841, "text": "- Well, actually I carved this one myself"}, {"start": 1237.841, "end": 1240.5209999999997, "text": "after lightning struck an oak tree in my backyard."}, {"start": 1240.5209999999997, "end": 1242.841, "text": "And then I made my nephew a rocking horse."}, {"start": 1242.841, "end": 1243.841, "text": "- That's adorable."}, {"start": 1243.841, "end": 1245.241, "text": "Smells heavenly."}, {"start": 1245.241, "end": 1245.3752857142856, "text": "Dr."}, {"start": 1245.3752857142856, "end": 1247.1209999999999, "text": "Rich, what sets your kettle corn apart?"}, {"start": 1247.1209999999999, "end": 1248.841, "text": "- Well, it's a secret ingredient,"}, {"start": 1248.841, "end": 1250.281, "text": "a couple extra pinches of love."}, {"start": 1250.281, "end": 1251.9609999999998, "text": "- No, you can't beat that."}, {"start": 1251.9609999999998, "end": 1252.801, "text": "- It feels good."}, {"start": 1252.801, "end": 1253.6409999999998, "text": "- Not this again."}, {"start": 1253.6409999999998, "end": 1256.5209999999997, "text": "- Rich, you know they're doing a fake morning show."}, {"start": 1256.5209999999997, "end": 1258.201, "text": "There are no cameras."}, {"start": 1258.201, "end": 1259.201, "text": "- I know."}, {"start": 1259.201, "end": 1261.201, "text": "It's just a fun way to start the day."}, {"start": 1261.201, "end": 1264.041, "text": "So grab a paddle partner and hop on in here."}, {"start": 1264.041, "end": 1265.721, "text": "- You know what that does, Sam?"}, {"start": 1265.721, "end": 1266.561, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1268.561, "end": 1272.561, "text": "♪ Troy and I've been in the morning ♪"}]}